selena: one more gotcha — consumers using `type: 'module'` sometimes fail to resolve the CJS fallback in older Next projects. recommend documenting a tiny recipe: "if you're on Next <13.4, force the CJS entry via require('.../dist/cjs')".

morgan: perfect. i'll draft a short PR: add runtime adapter + conditional exports + Vite notes. will ping for review when draft is up. thanks all. :raised_hands:

